  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Prologue_Expedition
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 1
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_EXPEDITION_01
    DefaultText: "진실을 찾기 위해 떠난\n첫 번째 원정대."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_EXPEDITION_02
    DefaultText: "그들마저 돌아오지\n않은 지 1년."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_EXPEDITION_03
    DefaultText: "이제, 두 번째 원정대가\n같은 철길 위에 선다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    Emotion: 0
    LocalizationKey: PROLOGUE_OPENING_EXPEDITION_04
    DefaultText: "열차는 다시, 얼어붙은\n북쪽을 향해 달린다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
